Steffen,

  To force the argument passed
to the program as a character, you must change the first line to:

guiCreate("Property", Name="first",
DialogControl="String", DialogPrompt="first", UseQuotes=T)

  Otherwise, it will look for an
object named whatever you typed in to the dialog box.

Dave

"Steffen Barembruch"
<Steffen at Barembruch.de> 

